    {
      "id": "7cf9e528590cb428",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 440,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 1180,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# ThunderMax topo\n\nNative Obsidian map of ThunderMax intel. **Green = live shop fact.** Red = conflict or brick-the-bike. Orange = Mar 30 ChatGPT session. Cyan = tower. Yellow = fab. Purple = library.\n\nHub notes: [[thundermax_command_center_2026-08-19]] \u00b7 [[chatgpt_shares]] \u00b7 [[user_bike]]",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "1104f9207e33df2a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -40,
      "y": -80,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "## Legend\n\n4 green \u2014 live / flash this\n1 red \u2014 conflict or do-not\n2 orange \u2014 rider session\n5 cyan \u2014 Command Center\n3 yellow \u2014 saddlebag brace\n6 purple \u2014 old manuals",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "d0701ce2b375b376",
      "type": "file",
      "x": -20,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "file": "brain/user_bike.md",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "06dfcb59015297cf",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -20,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## Injector timeline\n\n`user_bike` \u2192 **5.5 g/s** + SE 475\nMar 30 ChatGPT \u2192 **\"68 injectors\"** + shorty\nUSB Aug 19 \u2192 **6.3** + S&S 550 + 2-into-1\n\n**Live flash = 6.3.** Never `*55inj*` onto 6.3s.",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "79f0411b0e424f78",
      "type": "file",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 240,
      "file": "brain/thundermax_command_center_2026-08-19.md",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "70300cfd579ae741",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 910,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## Live hardware\n\n- 6.3 injectors\n- S&S 550 / CAM2\n- FuelMoto lineage\n- Exhaust **2-into-1**\n- Idle 1024\n- Decel cut OFF\n- AutoTune OFF at flash",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "3ecba8df43a71d01",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1270,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "## Flash-first\n\n`M8_131_550CAM_63inj.tbw`\n\nConfirm injector size **6.3** before WRITE.\nAfter WRITE: init if asked, hands off throttle, one start, both pipes hot in 30s or shut off.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "8098dc9a98c8352e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## Shared fingerprint\n\nBase-map **HXSSEDCAAN061617** \u2014 on `user_bike` *and* the live ThunderMax profile.\n\n`17AUG2025ATLRUNNINGGREATv6TODAY.tbw` = SE8-517 history. **v6 = version 6, not 6.3 injectors.** If TMax says 5.5, do not flash it onto 6.3s.",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "e8b813abb5dcfd53",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 190,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 140,
      "text": "## Command Center\n\nhttp://192.168.1.201:8181/\n\n`:8090` is AI Operator \u2014 do not steal it.\n`tmax-api` \u2192 `webui_server.py`",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "d1a61e361f7a2c64",
      "type": "link",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 120,
      "url": "https://github.com/joshtitan88-collab/Thundermax_Assistant",
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "29bd55b844134f2b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1680,
      "y": 490,
      "width": 460,
      "height": 160,
      "text": "## Hard no\n\nNever write `.tbw`. Flash in TMax Tuner on Windows.\nSpark \u00b12\u00b0/step. VE \u00b15%. No rear-timing-advance.\nVirtual dyno = house-limit model, not live ECU.",
      "color": "1"
    },
