    {
      "id": "100bea81fa94002c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1310,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## Rider feel\n\nWeak bottom end.\nFrom a stop: dives / falls on its nose, then picks up.\n\n**Tune first:** idle\u20132500, 0\u201320% TPS.",
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "61ee9c1fe55ae863",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 470,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "## Session numbers (Joshua-corrected)\n\nPeak timing **32\u00b0 at 5,632 RPM** (ChatGPT first said 51,200).\nAFR vs TPS ~3840 RPM started **~15.0 at low TPS** \u2192 12.5\u201312.8 WOT.\nAFR-vs-temp **1.5 is an OFFSET, not AFR 1.5:1.** AutoTune looked off.\n\nTaught to tower KB 2026-08-25 via `tmax learn`. Share: https://chatgpt.com/share/6a8d5426-8c60-83e9-bb39-138482c63f9c",
      "color": "2"
    },
